Start with this simplest system statement:

> We have a fixed set of floors and a fixed set of elevators. Every elevator can serve every floor. A request is created when someone at a floor presses UP or DOWN. The controller chooses an elevator based on its current state and position.

And one correction: **you do not need `User` inside the request at all.** The system doesn't care who pressed the button.

So your external request can be just:

